 DFT-FE branch: workshopBranch, commit: a18af6ab64d1aabd7281b89530763d1703e62543
 compiled with GPU support, using CUDA, with device-aware MPI support, with NCCL support, with OpenMP support, with 64 bit integers, and with HIGHERQUAD_PSP
